su name verify ob text input to name text output be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this for name verify mind brief to name text output be write do
  su name output ret
prah

su name verify ob text input to name text output with wo tools be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this for name verify mind brief to name text output with wo tools be write do
  su name output ret
prah

su name verify ob text input for name mind target to name text output be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this for name of for of this to name text output be write do
  su name output ret
prah

su name verify ob text input for name mind target to name text output with wo tools be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this for name of for of this to name text output with wo tools be write do
  su name output ret
prah

exists su name verify be export ya
